{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"agent_message","text":"The read consumer matches completions by exact context. The leader’s batched confirmation path retains each request’s context internally, but uses the newest context for all remote replies; local completions use each request’s own context. I’ll register this as a correlation question. A legal execution history and applicable obligation still need to be established before calling it a defect.\n"}}
